        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "- Prime Location In Prestigeous Bellevue Development\r\n\r\n-Large 3-Bedroom 3-Bathroom Semi-Detached Family Home\r\n\r\n-Opposite Large Open Green Space With Mountain Views\r\n\r\n-Parking For Two Cars & Ample Adjacent Guest Parking \r\n\r\n- Finished To Highn Specification\r\n\r\n- Excellent A-Rated BER Including Mechanical Ventilation Heat Recovery System\r\n\r\nPremium Collection are delighted to bring to the market this outstanding 3- bedroom, 3-bathroom semi detached family home ideally located within the prestigious Bellevue development and just a short distance from the beautiful village of Delgany. Enjoying an enviable position overlooking a large open green space with wonderful views of the surrounding mountains this home is ideal for young families as well as those that enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nFinished to an exceptional standard the accommodation comprises a welcoming and spacious entrance hall with solid timber flooring, a large and bright living room with feature fireplace to the front, flowing through to an open plan bespoke kitchen/dining and family area featuring quality integrated appliances and a central kitchen island ideal for entertaining. There is also a good sized utility room off the kitchen together with a large bathroom accessed from the the hall.  \r\n\r\nUpstairs, a spacious landing leads to two guest bedrooms and a wonderful master bedroom including ample fitted wardrobes and ensuite bathroom offering a bath/shower combination and floor to ceiling tile. Once again, the prime location of this home ensures no overlooking from neighbouring houses and excellent woodland and mountain views from all of the bedrooms. The main bathroom is light and bright and includes another bath/shower combination with floor to ceiling tile.\r\n\r\nOutside comprises a good sized fully enclosed private rear garden capturing lots of sunlight and includes a large garden shed. To the front the westerly aspect and the open green space opposite offers a feeling of wide open spaciousness combined with mountain and sea views.\r\n\r\nThis home offers excellent storage spaces both upstairs and down as well as substantial storage space in the attic. There is also excellent scope for enlargement both up in the roof (subject to planning permission) as  well as to the rear. \r\n\r\nBellevue Hill offers beautifully maintained green spaces with excellent mountain and sea views together with a playground area exclusive to the residents, creating a warm, family-friendly community atmosphere. The development’s meticulous design and immaculate landscaping all combine to further enhance its appeal and desirablity.\r\n\r\nDelgany village, a short distance away, is steeped in charm and history, offering a wide array of services, artisan shops, and dining options. Popular additions such as the Pigeon House Café, artisan bakery, gourmet delicatessen, and organic butcher, as well as the character-filled Horse & Hound pub, create a vibrant and welcoming community.\r\n\r\nNearby Greystones town offers even more amenities, with an excellent selection of restaurants, boutiques, cafés, and shops, as well as highly regarded schools and leisure facilities. The area is rich in outdoor opportunities, with woodland and mountain walks, beaches, and the renowned Bray to Greystones Cliff Walk all within easy reach. Sports enthusiasts are spoiled for choice, with a selection of prestigious golf clubs including Delgany, Greystones, and Druids Glen, along with the Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool.\r\n\r\nCommuters will particularly appreciate the home’s proximity to the N11/M50, local bus routes, the DART/Mainline rail station, and the Aircoach service to Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
